cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BatteryGuard in research, please cite this software and clearly state the version and synthetic/real dataset used."
title: "BatteryGuard"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
authors:
  - family-names: "Ding"
    given-names: "Yu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dingyucanada/BatteryGuard"
url: "https://dingyucanada.github.io/BatteryGuard/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - battery lifetime prediction
  - conformal prediction
  - out-of-distribution detection
  - charging policy simulation
  - safety shield
  - evidence ledger
abstract: >-
  BatteryGuard is an offline, simulation-only research prototype for auditable
  early-cycle lifetime estimation, uncertainty and OOD-aware abstention,
  transparent charging-policy simulation, deterministic safety gating, and
  a controlled synthetic outcome-reveal and access-control rehearsal. The
  public fixture is not an independent blind benchmark.
